    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Alloy of Trust.</strong> People who have seen you work learn that things you touch come back better.</p><ul><li>You gain a small mechanical bonus on <strong>Diplomacy (Presence)</strong> checks to convince others to let you <strong>repair, modify, or ritually work on</strong> their gear, relics, or sacred spaces.</li><li>When dealing with communities that have directly benefited from your repairs or healing in the past, the GM may reroll the lowest die on those checks.</li></ul>",
